ement mechanism is weak by design, and the political coalition backing it includes the exact venture capital firms that stand to capture the financial windfall.\n\nWhile policymakers argue over whether this software will save human civilization or destroy it, nobody is looking at the water table in Iowa supplying the data centers. Nobody is looking at the labor conditions of the workers training the models. The debate over compensation funds ignores concrete material reality in favor of abstract risk management. Congress should reject any statutory immunity deal and leave the courthouse doors wide open for every person harmed by corporate code.",
